      "text": "To find the difference between $2.43$ and $1.2$, we perform the subtraction as follows:\n\n\\[\n2.43 - 1.2 = (2 + 0.43) - 1.2 = 1 + (0.43 - 1.2) = 1 + (-0.77)\n\\]\n\nNow, we calculate the subtraction of $0.77$ from $1$:\n\n\\[\n1 - 0.77 = 0.23\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the result of $2.43 - 1.2$ is $\\boxed{1.23}$.",
